{"id":"643529","name":"酸豆角肉末米粉","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643529/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酸豆角","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材:泡好的米粉、肉末、葱花。","img":"images/643529/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中放油，放入肉末炒散。","img":"images/643529/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入酸豆角翻炒几下。","img":"images/643529/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入一勺蚝油。","img":"images/643529/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入一勺酱油。","img":"images/643529/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入辣椒油。","img":"images/643529/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/643529/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量的水。","img":"images/643529/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入盐调味。","img":"images/643529/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮开两分钟后放入葱花关火。","img":"images/643529/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"另起锅烧水，水开放入泡好的米粉烫三十秒。","img":"images/643529/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捞出放入碗中。","img":"images/643529/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把做好的臊子舀在米粉上拌匀即可。","img":"images/643529/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/643529/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}